hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"492","Amr ibn al-Hubab ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn al-Harith al-Makhzumi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Zubayr ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne al-Yasa' ibn al-Mughirah se, unhon ne kaha: Khalid ibn al-Walid ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se apne makan ki tangi ki shikayat ki to Aap ne farmaya: Aasman ki taraf wus'at ikhtiyar karo."
"493","Abdullah ibn Muhammad aur Ali ibn Sahl al-Ramliyyan ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah ibn al-Ala se, unhon ne Atiyyah ibn Qays se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki azwaj ke hujre khajoor ki tehniyon ke the. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) apne ek ghazwe me tashreef le gaye aur Umm Salamah khush-haal thin to unhon ne tehniyon ki jagah kachi eenten laga din. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye kya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne chaha ke logon ki nigahon ko apne se rok dun. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Umm Salamah sab se buri cheez jis me Musalman mard ka maal kharch ho woh imarat hai."
"494","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ayb ibn al-Habhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu al-Aliyah se ke al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib ne ek bala khana banaya to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Ise gira do. Unhon ne kaha: Kya main is ke kharch ke barabar Allah ki rah me sadqa kar dun. Aap ne farmaya: Ise gira do, to unhon ne ise gira diya."
"495","Ghassan ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Dawud ibn Qays se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne hujre dekhe jo khajoor ki tehniyon ke the aur bahar se balon ke taton se dhake hue the aur main ne hujre ke darwaze se ghar ke darwaze tak hujre ka arz taqreeban chhe ya saat haath samjha aur andar wale ghar ka andaza das haath lagaya aur mera khayal hai ke us ki unchai aath aur nau ke darmiyan thi aur isi tarah, aur main Aishah ke darwaze par khada hua to woh maghrib ki taraf rukh kiye hue tha."
"496","Ghassan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hurayth ibn al-Sa'ib se: Main ne al-Hasan ko kehte hue suna: Main Uthman ibn Affan ki khilafat ke dauran Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki azwaj ke gharon me dakhil hota tha to apne haath se un ki chhat ko chhu leta tha."
"497","Main ne Qutaybah ibn Sa'id ko parh kar sunaya: Ibn Abi Fudayk ne tumhen bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Hilal se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Aishah ka darwaza sagwan ki lakri ka tha."
